> Y[oga] guru Baba Ramdev Saturday[ criticised][ the][ Congress][ party] for[ nominating] cricketing[ legend] Sach[in][ Tend]ulkar to the[ Raj][ya][ Sabha][,][ calling][ it][ a] ploy to[ distract] public[ attention][.]
