> For the[ month] of[ April][ only][:] Re[ceive] Derm[ap][en] 4[ Face] & Neck[ Treatment][ +] An Al[gin]ate[ Mask] +[ Ion]Zyme[ Machine] Treatment[ for][ only] R[1][,][500] (all[ inclusive][).]
[We] are proud[ to] launch the[ new][ D][erm]apen 4[ at] Natural Aesthetics. We[ were][ the] first clinic[ in][ South] Africa to[ receive][ the][ D]ermapen 4.[ So] what[ makes][ the][ D][erm]apen 4 so[ much] better than the Dermapen 3 or[ any][ other] mic[rone]ed[ling] device?
[D]erm[ap][en][ 4][ has] a[ 16] needle[ cartridge][ instead][ of][ just][ 12][ needles], reaching an inflammatory response at[ a] much[ quicker] rate.[
]The Dermap[en][ 4][ generates] 47.9[%] more[ micro]-channels[ than][ D][erm]apen[ 3] and[ 104]%[ more] micro-channels[ than][ any] counterfeit[ device].
[The][ D][erm][ap]en[ 4] generates 1,[920] punct[ure][ channels] per second[,] which[ means] we[ can][ almost][ double] the amount[ of] ser[ums] and[ act][ives] that[ we] needle into the skin per treatment[,] than[ before][.][
]The additional 620[ micro][-]ch[annels] makes the[ treatment] much[ quicker] and[ more] comfortable than[ before][.][
]Derm[ap][en][ 4] is[ the] only[ mic]rone[ed][ling] device with a dedicated scar[ setting] and[ protocols] for revision[ of][ deep][,] at[rophic][ scars];[ including][ surgical][,] burn contracture, striae[ and][ post][-][ac][ne] scars[.][ Need]le[ penetration][ can][ now][ be][ increased] up to[ 3][.][0][mm].[
]AOVN[ technology][,] automatically[ calibr][ates][ the][ motor][ speed], pressure and penetration for targeted[ precision].
The D[erm]apen[ 4][ is] safer[ than] other mic[rone]ed[ling][ devices], no dragging or[ pulling] of the[ skin][.]
[Only] D[erm]ap[en] 4[ features] a unique[,] medical[-]grade[ silicone] seal and[ fluid][ guard]. The[ external] cartridge[ is] fortified with a[ special]ised[ fluid][ guard] that prevents cross contamination to the outer cartridge[ shell][.] Safety[ First]!
Specialised[ retention][ valves][ relieve] the build[-]up of procedural pressure[ within] the[ D][erm][ap][en] 4[ needle][ cartridge].[ The][ effect][ prevents][ fluid][ build][-][up][ within][ the] needle[ cavity].[ The] vacuum-like[ sensation][ removes] the[ risk] of[ cross][ contamination][ whilst][ ensuring][ pressure][-][free] contact[ to][ the] skin[ during] a procedure.
[Top][:][ Medical] grade[ num]bing cream applied for[ 20] –[ 30][ minutes][,] we[ then][ needle][ medical] grade serums and act[ives] into the[ skin] via the Derm[ap]en[ 4] device. Bottom:[ An] Alginate Mask is applied and connected to[ our][ Ion]Z[y]me[ Machine]. A medical[ grade][ conceal][er][ is][ applied][ to][ speed][ up] recovery[ and] cover[ any][ immediate][ post] treatment red

